{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.WeakEquivInvariance","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.WeakEquivInvariance","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.LinearMap.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.LinearMap.Basic"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.weak_equiv_transitive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.weak_equiv_transitive","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L96-L116","doc":"Weak equivalence invariance is transitive: if levels n ∼ m and\nm ∼ k share the same direct limit algebra and vacuum state,\nthen τ at level n equals τ at level k.\n\nWe express this within a single WeakEquivInvariance over three\nlevels: srcLevel = n, midLevel = m, tgtLevel = k. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.invariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.invariance","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L92-L92","doc":"**Invariance**: for all elements a ∈ A_∞,\n`τ(ιₙ(a|ₙ)) = τ(ιₘ(a|ₘ))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.vac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.vac","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L89-L89","doc":"The vacuum state on A_∞. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.weq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.weq","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L87-L87","doc":"The weak equivalence data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance.mk","kind":"ctor","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L85-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivInvariance","kind":"structure","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L79-L94","doc":"**Weak equivalence invariance**: the expectation value\n`τ(ιₙ(a|ₙ))` is independent of the brane level `n`.\n\nThis ensures that physical predictions do not depend on which\nlevel of the brane tower we compute them at. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState.tau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState.tau","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L77-L77","doc":"The vacuum state as a linear functional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState.mk","kind":"ctor","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LinearVacuumState","kind":"structure","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L58-L77","doc":"**Linear vacuum state**: a linear functional `τ : A_∞ → R`.\n\nRenamed from `VacuumState` (bean `qou-u87j`). That name is already taken,\nin the same namespace, by a **different** structure:\n`QOU.Torsion.VacuumState` in `lean/QOU/Torsion/BraneTower.lean:66` is the\nreal-valued state of `prop:vacuum-state`, carrying `invariant` and\n`extends_haar`. This one is the `R`-linear functional that\n`def:weak-equiv-invariance` needs, over a generic ring and a generic\nmodule.\n\nThey are not two copies of one declaration that drifted apart — they are\ntwo concepts that collided on a name, which is the case the mirror-drift\nchecker's own limits section warns it cannot distinguish. Making them match\nwould merge two different things; renaming is the fix. The block that owns\nthe bare name is `prop:vacuum-state`, so this one yields it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.zigzag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.zigzag","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The zigzag map connecting level n to level m. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.tgtLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.tgtLevel","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Target level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.srcLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.srcLevel","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Source level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.restrict","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.restrict","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Restriction of an element of A_∞ to level n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.embed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.embed","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Canonical embedding of level n into A_∞. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instDL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instDL","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The direct limit carries a module structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instDLAddCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instDLAddCommGroup","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The direct limit is an additive abelian group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.DirectLimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.DirectLimit","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The direct limit algebra A_∞. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instModule","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Each level carries a module structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instAddCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.instAddCommGroup","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Each level is an additive abelian group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.AlgAtLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.AlgAtLevel","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The algebra at each brane level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.WeakEquivalence","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/weak-equiv-invariance.lean#L26-L53","doc":"**Weak equivalence between brane levels**.\n\nA zigzag of coface and codegeneracy maps connecting level `n`\nto level `m` in the cosimplicial crossed groupoid. ","signatureChunk":0}]}